<Layout title="Just Capture Terms of Use">
    <h1>Just Capture Terms of Use</h1>
    <p>
        <em>Last updated: November 17, 2026</em>
    </p>

    <p>
        These terms cover your use of Just Capture ("the App"), an iPhone app
