    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>
                Just Capture is not an emergency service. If you're in danger,
                contact the police or your local emergency number.
            </strong>
        </li>
        <li>
            The App tries to upload your clips and email the people you choose,
            but it can't guarantee that either will happen.
        </li>
        <li>
            You're responsible for following the recording laws where you are.
        </li>
        <li>
            Your recordings live on your phone and in your own Google account. We
